## Bilinear Patch, once the pinned defect from SPEC.md Section 8: Patch
## rasterized no pixels. getRSPatch (phase 6) wires bilinear and bicubic
## Patch to createParametric; this scene now renders. No golden minted --
## bilinear interpolation of a flat four-point patch has no shading detail
## worth pixel-regression protection.
##
## A Sphere shares the scene as a control: same lighting, same shader,
## proving the renderer itself works and the Patch pixels are its own.
Display "patch_norender.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 200 200 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
LightSource "ambientlight" 1 "intensity" [0.6]
Sides 2
Surface "matte" "Ka" [1] "Kd" [0]
AttributeBegin
	Translate -1 0 0
	Patch "bilinear" "P" [-0.5 -0.5 0  0.5 -0.5 0  -0.5 0.5 0  0.5 0.5 0]
AttributeEnd
AttributeBegin
	Translate 1 0 0
	Sphere 0.5 -0.5 0.5 360
AttributeEnd
WorldEnd
